<title>UK: Credit Local sets 100 million Ecu Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 100 million Ecu Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Internationale a Luxembourg.</p>
<p>BORROWER  CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    16.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.40    PAY DATE  S-16.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+4.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
